      "name": "mcp__evimed__geo_read",
      "source": "mcp",
      "description": "Read this 循证 GEO project's product, claims, questions, journey, diagnosis, metrics, answers, errors, sources, strategy, targets, articles, orders and monitoring. Cards carry quote-checked evidence and citation ids. Value holds scoped findings, research and coverage; research lists specialist tasks. filter.version reads a prior value basis. Numeric cells retain denominators and status; unknown is never zero.",
